# Unit calls of GroundBehindKind7 (81:B5D0), which no code refers to:
# whether the tile behind the actor at probe $20, or else at $24, has
# behaviour low bits 7 (1), else 0. No level's map has such a tile (all
# 29 stage states' maps read from WRAM dumps), so the second call crafts
# one. In level 4 (stage a1 s0) on Aladdin's record (M and X 8-bit, DB
# $80, his flip $08F0 0 so behind is to the right; probe $20 is 8 across
# and 22 up, $24 10 across and 4 down), the view's y ($1777) $0060, the
# machine put back after each. At $0440, $00D8 neither tile has it; then
# the same with the behaviour of tile $13 (under probe $20, at $0448,
# $00C2; $7E:C813, $02) set to $07.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s0.state
wait 5
set $001777 60,00
set $0008E7 40,04
set $0008EA D8,00
set $0008F0 00
call 81B5D0 long d=08DB db=80 p=30
set $001777 60,00
set $0008E7 40,04
set $0008EA D8,00
set $0008F0 00
set $7EC813 07
call 81B5D0 long d=08DB db=80 p=30
